OL,3,GNEWSATown council to ask for assurance
OL,4,Aover asylum plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to house asylum seekers at a
OL,7,Fformer North Yorkshire military base
OL,8,Fare set to be opposed by a town council
OL,9,F50 miles (80km) away from the site.
OL,11,FThe Home Office announced earlier this
OL,12,Fyear it would seek planning permission
OL,13,Fto use the ex-RAF Linton-on-Ouse, near
OL,14,FYork, to house up to 1,200 asylum
OL,15,Fseekers while their claims were
OL,16,Fprocessed.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
