OL,3,GNEWSATown council to ask for assurance
OL,4,Aover asylum plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform-led Scarborough Town Council has
OL,7,Fsaid it was seeking "urgent assurance"
OL,8,Ffrom the Home Office and North
OL,9,FYorkshire Council the seaside town
OL,10,Fwould not be used as a placement area
OL,11,Ffor those who had been processed
OL,12,Fwithout "a comprehensive, open
OL,13,Fconsultation".
OL,15,FNorth Yorkshire Council has already
OL,16,Funanimously opposed the plans in a
OL,17,Fmotion passed last month.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
